                        newarray 2
                        newarray 1
                        pushstring "……"
                        newarray 1
                        newarray 4
                        pushbyte 11
                        pushstring "多罗"
                        pushbyte 0
                        pushstring "改变历史！那那那我们现在这个失忆的情况难道就是改变历史？可以说是蒙对了吧。"
                        newarray 2
                        newarray 1
                        pushstring "……"
                        newarray 1
                        newarray 4
                        pushbyte 10
                        pushstring "巴蒂"
                        pushbyte 0
                        pushstring "这样说来，雷伊和现在的一切有着莫大的关系啊！雷伊，你怎么看？"
                        newarray 2
                        newarray 1
                        pushstring "……"
                        newarray 1
                        newarray 4
                        pushshort 477
                        pushstring "雷伊"
                        pushbyte 0
